{
  "notes": [
    "The user's signed statement of an order's input token count. TaskOrderV3 is a closed signed field list, so the count is bound to the order by its digest and signed separately, with the same key and scheme as the order.",
    "order_digest of the vector is the digest of task_order_v3.json's base vector; input_token_count 2 matches the input_2_generated_3 case of token_ids_v1.json.",
    "A consumer that does not know this domain ignores the attestation; a chain whose input_token_tolerance is zero ignores it too."
  ],
